The tsgraph package draws in the style of RRDtool and MRTG, and uses their
colour conventions, but implements its own axis and scaling algorithms. The
vertical scale follows Paul S. Heckbert, "Nice Numbers for Graph Labels",
Graphics Gems, 1990.
